<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - L.A. Harbor Dept 2019, 2023 bonds.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - L.A. Harbor Dept 2019, 2023 bonds.</headline>
<text>
<p>HARBOR DEPARTMENT OF THE CITY OF LOS ANGELES</p>
<p>RE: $320,000,000</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS, ISSUE OF 1996</p>
<p>Effective at 9:20 A.M. E.S.T., Thursday, December 5, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>from the following maturities:</p>
<p>11/01/2019 B (AMT)  11/01/2023 B (AMT)</p>
<p>They will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>ABN Amro Securities</p>
<p>IN ASSOCIATION WITH:</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
